---
// The problem statement, directly under the hero. Replaces the old two-column
// "status quo?" block, which spoke to business leaders and marketing leaders
// separately; the positioning now addresses marketing leaders only.
---

<section class="bg-gls-paper px-4 py-20">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center">
    <h2 class="font-heading text-3xl font-bold text-gls-green-dark sm:text-4xl">
      For marketing leaders who need more support.
    </h2>
    <p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-relaxed">
      You have a lot to get done, but a small internal team to do it.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed">
      We plug in as an extension of your team, helping with strategy and consistently getting the
      work done.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
